The Python author who wrote `src/locales/en.json`, called `I18n(Path(__file__).
parent / "locales")`, got working runtime strings, shipped both files because
`add_python_artifacts` packs `src/` recursively — and got nothing from the daemon,
which reads only `<plugin>/locales/*.json`.

Without this rule an absent `locales/` reports "nothing declared, nothing to
check", which is an empty scan wearing a pass's clothes. N1 keeps its id and
changes its severity, which is why the id looks like a note in a fail case.
